sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-vogel-phyllotaxis> a pk:Claim ;
        rdfs:label "Vogel (1979) & Douady–Couder (1992) Golden-Angle Phyllotaxis faithfully reproduces Helianthus annuus (sunflower capitulum) morphology" ;
        dct:description "The simulation script(s) 1979-vogel-phyllotaxis.py, docs/media/vogel_phyllotaxis_growth.gif, vogel_phyllotaxis_metrics.csv implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Helianthus annuus (sunflower capitulum) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 85.9/100, audit 2026-10-18-phyllotaxis-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
        pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/c89d18d/1979-vogel-phyllotaxis.py, https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/c89d18d/docs/media/vogel_phyllotaxis_growth.gif, https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/c89d18d/vogel_phyllotaxis_metrics.csv; output: vogel_phyllotaxis_comparison.png; organism: Helianthus annuus (sunflower capitulum); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/c89d18d; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 5df8c2b4cc4b9b4a86ea26aace00ebd26df8456a62d99c23287ddcea2644e06c; artifact_sha256: 3ab57a6be31aab64ec4cfa6db34f77b8f19cb2744a812f3fba01a6c8f26f1c3c; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/phyllotaxis/helianthus_annuus_capitulum_specimen.jpg=c76483eea3e564fe..., datasets/phyllotaxis/helianthus_parastichy_annotated.jpg=7cd34354e23584cb..., datasets/phyllotaxis/phyllotaxis_reference.json=432d1eeebf62bdc7...}; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-18-phyllotaxis-audit; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Vogel (1979) defines planar capitulum spiral placement r_n = c*sqrt(n), theta_n = n*alpha_0 with golden divergence angle alpha_0 = 360/tau^2 = 137.507764 deg | Douady & Couder (1992, 1996) demonstrate self-organized convergence of repulsive Hofmeister primordia on a radially advecting meristem ring to the golden and Lucas noble angles | Swinton, Ochu & MSI Turing's Sunflower Consortium (2016) report 768 photoreviewed parastichy counts across 657 Helianthus annuus heads (82.3% Fibonacci structure; 49 Fib-1 vs 17 Fib+1, binomial p = 5.07e-5); reconstructed_in_script: Planar Vogel spiral generator, Delaunay/Voronoi rising Fibonacci parastichy cascade (8,13)->(13,21)->(21,34)->(34,55), bounded Voronoi area CV & circularity optimality, Douady-Couder Hofmeister relaxation, DoG floret segmentation on helianthus_annuus_capitulum_specimen.jpg, and rim-dislocation ensemble reproducing Fib-1 > Fib+1; transfer_boundary: Outer-rim Delaunay contact-chain loss on noisy capitula used to model the empirical excess of Fibonacci-1 over Fibonacci+1 counts in Swinton et al. (2016); does_not_claim: Full 3D auxin PIN1 transport PDE simulation on a curved dome (uses Vogel's kinematic spiral and Douady & Couder's effective Hofmeister inhibitory potential)]; other sources: Phyllotaxis: A Systemic Study in Plant Morphogenesis <https://www.cambridge.org/9780521404822>" ;
        pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1006/jtbi.1996.0024>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1016/0025-5564(79)90080-4>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsos.160091>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.68.2098> ;
        pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-18-phyllotaxis-audit-v2-vogel-phyllotaxis-code-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-18-phyllotaxis-audit-v2-vogel-phyllotaxis-model-fidelity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-18-phyllotaxis-audit-v2-vogel-phyllotaxis-morphometric-validation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-18-phyllotaxis-audit-v2-vogel-phyllotaxis-overall>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-18-phyllotaxis-audit-v2-vogel-phyllotaxis-parameter-expressivity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-18-phyllotaxis-audit-v2-vogel-phyllotaxis-repro-package>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-18-phyllotaxis-audit-v2-vogel-phyllotaxis-source-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-18-phyllotaxis-audit-v2-vogel-phyllotaxis-specimen-match> ;
        pk:weightOfEvidence "0.859"^^xsd:double .
}

